GOLAEM FOR USD 9.3.3 - CHANGELOG - November 18th 2026
-----------------------------------------------------

** New features

- Added support for PRef in the Golaem For USD plugin


** Bug fixes

- Fixed a crash when displaying bounding boxes in the Golaem for USD plugin
- Fixed frame range cropping when using Time Offset layers in the Golaem for USD plugin
- Fixed Golaem For USD plugin not loading in Katana 5


** Supported Rendering Engines

- USD - Standalone 0.25.11 / For MayaUSD 0.35.0 / For Houdini 21.0 / For Katana 5




GOLAEM FOR USD 9.3.2 - CHANGELOG - July 22nd 2026
-------------------------------------------------

** Important notice

GolaemForUSD, GolaemForUnreal and GolaemForHoudini have been open sourced and are available on https://github.com/autodesk in case you want to build them yourself with an unsupported version of USD, Unreal or Houdini


** Supported Rendering Engines

- USD - Standalone 0.25.11 / For MayaUSD 0.35.0 / For Houdini 20.0 / For Katana 5




